{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6","text":"# Jackenstein\n🎃 Found in the library of the Dark Sanctuary (Ch.4); his fight takes place in complete darkness."},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":220,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/Jackenstein_overworld_Halloween_decoration.png"},{"id":"s0","type":"text","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**Kris**\nIt's Kris's SOUL —not the Player's— that emits the light needed to defeat him; the fight itself is used narratively to underline that the two souls are separate things."},{"id":"s1","type":"text","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**Susie**\nShe's the only one able to fully heal him, after the Old Man's encouragement — a small moment of personal growth for her magic."},{"id":"s2","type":"text","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**Gerson Boom**\nAs Old Man, he's the one who pushes Susie to try to heal Jackenstein when Ralsei's spells aren't enough — and, according to the wiki itself, the two of them were supposedly \"former roommates\" within the Sanctuary."},{"id":"s3","type":"text","x":-800,"y":300,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**The face under the mask**\nIt hides a real face shaped like a small candle, with ears, an antenna, and dot-like eyes — the real reason he needs total darkness."},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","x":-800,"y":80,"width":170,"height":190,"file":"Sprites/Jackenstein_overworld_blush.gif"},{"id":"s4","type":"text","x":700,"y":-640,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3","text":"**The 'No Pumpkin' maze**\nFive symbols (King, Queen, sword, Jack, flower) — the flower points to the Flower Kingdom of Ch.5, already confirmed after its release."},{"id":"s5","type":"text","x":-800,"y":-450,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"3","text":"**Card pattern**\nLike Jevil (Joker), King, and Queen, Jackenstein represents the Jack — the same naming system as the rest of the Card Kingdom's bosses."},{"id":"s6","type":"text","x":700,"y":460,"width":300,"height":210,"color":"1","text":"**Ch.5 — Top Bakery**\nBecause of his size he isn't taken to Castle Town right away; in Ch.5 he appears working inside the Top Bakery."},{"id":"s6-img","type":"file","x":700,"y":690,"width":220,"height":150,"file":"Sprites/Jackenstein_screenshot_tower_climb.png"},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Kris_overworld_static.png","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/gerson-grave.png","x":420,"y":10,"width":240,"height":180},{"id":"s4-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Jackenstein_battle_dancing_jack-o'-lantern.gif","x":1048,"y":-811,"width":190,"height":170}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s0","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s1","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s2","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s3","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e3_img","fromNode":"s3-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s6","toSide":"left","color":"1"},{"id":"e6_img","fromNode":"s6-img","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s6","toSide":"bottom","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s2-img","fromNode":"s2-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s4-img","fromNode":"s4-img","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s4","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_face_maze","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s4","toSide":"top","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_susie_gerson","fromNode":"s1","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_cards_maze","fromNode":"s5","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"cross_kris_face","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"cross_bakery_susie","fromNode":"s6","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"}]}